18:["$","main",null,{"id":"main-content","className":"min-h-screen bg-bg pt-24 pb-16","children":["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-6","children":[["$","header",null,{"className":"mb-12","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-2","children":"Lead Generation Diagnostics"}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"heading-1 text-fg md:text-5xl","children":"Run a Free Lead Gen Landing Page Audit to Boost Inbound CVR"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-4 text-lg text-fg-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl","children":"Lead gen pages with paid traffic fail in specific, repeatable ways. Forms that ask too many questions. Submit buttons that say “Submit.” No trust signal at the moment of commitment. No statement of what happens after the visitor clicks. This guide covers each failure pattern with the signal it trips and a bounded fix."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center gap-3","children":[["$","$L1f",null,{"href":"/audit?utm_source=lead-gen-audit-hero&utm_medium=hero-cta","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded bg-accent px-6 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-bg transition-opacity hover:opacity-85","children":"Get your free audit →"}],["$","$L1f",null,{"href":"/repair-sprint","className":"inline-flex min-h-[44px] items-center justify-center rounded border border-border px-5 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-fg-muted transition-colors hover:border-fg-muted hover:text-fg","children":"Explore $97 Repair Sprint"}]]}]]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"mb-14","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-fg mb-6","children":"Six lead gen–specific conversion failures"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-4","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"01"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"Form field count"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-fg","children":"More than 5 fields on a cold-traffic form"}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6 mb-3 pl-7","children":"Cold traffic has no prior relationship with the brand. Each additional required field is an additional qualification gate the visitor must pass before receiving what was promised in the ad. Beyond 5 fields - name, email, and minimal delivery context - completion rate drops with each added input. Phone number, company size, budget, and job title belong on a qualification call, not the entry form."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"pl-7 border-l-2 border-accent/30 ml-7","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold text-accent uppercase tracking-wider mb-1","children":"Fix"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-sm text-fg-muted leading-6","children":"Audit every field on the form against one question: is this required to deliver what I promised in the ad? Remove any field that fails. Collect qualification data on a follow-up step after the initial conversion - not as a gatekeeper to it."}]]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"rounded-xl border border-border bg-bg-muted/20 p-6","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-start gap-3 mb-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"shrink-0 font-mono text-xs text-fg-dim mt-0.5","children":"02"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-accent mb-0.5","children":"CTA label"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"text-base font-semibold text-fg","children":"'Submit' as the form button label"}]]}]]}],"$L28","$L29"]}],"$L2a","$L2b","$L2c","$L2d"]}]]}],"$L2e","$L2f","$L30","$L31"]}]}]
